---
title:    "Functional Logic Programming: From Theory to Curry"
citation: "(Programming Logics - Essays in Memory of Harald Ganzinger)"
url:      "http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-37651-1_6"
date:     2013-01-01
---
This papers surveys general features of functional logic languages,
and discusses the design, implementation, extensions, and applications of Curry.